# Fullstack quality gates

Run when `packages/api` or cross-app HTTP contract changes.

## Recommended order

| Step | Command | When |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 1 | `pnpm --filter @repo/api build` | Any `packages/api` change |
| 2 | `pnpm --filter api lint` + `test` + `build` | BE touched |
| 3 | `pnpm --filter web check-types` + `lint` + `build` | FE touched |
| 4 | `pnpm build` (root) | CI parity / release |

## Agents

- BE: [quality-gates](../BE/agents/quality-gates/SKILL.md) — [COMMAND_POLICY](../BE/agents/_shared/COMMAND_POLICY.md)
- FE: [quality-gates](../FE/agents/quality-gates/SKILL.md)
- Both: **reviewer** last on respective diffs

